To convert $8888_{10}$ to base 8, we repeatedly divide by 8 and keep track of the remainders.
\begin{align*} 8888 \div 8 &= 1111 \text{ with remainder } 0 \\ 1111 \div 8 &= 138 \text{ with remainder } 7 \\ 138 \div 8 &= 17 \text{ with remainder } 2 \\ 17 \div 8 &= 2 \text{ with remainder } 1 \\ 2 \div 8 &= 0 \text{ with remainder } 2 \end{align*}
Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we find that $8888_{10} = 21270_8$.

Now, we want to find the sum of the digits in the base-8 expression $21270_8$. The sum of the digits is $2 + 1 + 2 + 7 + 0 = 12$.

\boxed{12}

